      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "JIT-RL (Jan 2026): Continual learning không cần gradient updates — agents cải thiện bằng cách dynamically constructing experience-rich prompts từ accumulated interaction logs, đạt RL-like adaptation hoàn toàn qua context manipulation. Jan 2026 paper (arXiv 2601.18699): continual fine-tuning trên LRMs — catastrophic forgetting không giảm mà tăng. 2025-2026: catastrophic forgetting moved từ academic curiosity thành production engineering challenge khi agents graduate từ session-scoped chatbots thành persistent multi-month services.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol | web: zylos.ai, reddit r/artificial",
      "lang": "vi",
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T22:36:04.731148+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "699022ef8dbcc954dfb568a2367dfe0f"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "A-MEM: Agentic Memory (Feb 2026) — memory operations (store, retrieve, update, summarize, discard) exposed như callable tools qua 3-stage RL pipeline với step-wise GRPO. Agent tự học memory strategies từ experience: preemptive summarization trước context overflow, selective forgetting redundant entries, proactive linking related concepts. Agentic memory pushing structured representations vào editable core memory — không còn append-then-summarize lossy approach.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol | web: zylos.ai",
      "lang": "vi",
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T22:36:04.731148+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "2f6b3945ba3f92f7e5b542f8834d6d72"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "Continual/Lifelong learning 2026: Stability-plasticity dilemma là core challenge — model cần plasticity (học task mới) nhưng stability (không quên task cũ). 3 approach chính: (1) Replay-based: strategic rehearsal past experiences — borrow từ neuroscience, (2) Regularization: protect important weights (EWC, SI — synaptic intelligence) — penalize changes to crucial parameters, (3) Dynamic architectures: expand capacity cho new tasks không destroy old knowledge (progressive networks, dynamic expansion).",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol | web: nature, techrxiv, billionhopes.ai",
      "lang": "vi",
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T22:36:04.731148+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "c251e633b2711581e5c9bee4b3e62ab1"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI自我学习",
      "content": "集成学习：结合多个模型预测来提高整体性能。通过投票、平均或堆叠等方法减少方差和偏差。",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "lang": "zh",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T16:02:30.226695+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "d3425ead46a690e73cd90ecb94a5ed98"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI自己学習",
      "content": "アンサンブル学習：複数のモデル予測を組み合わせて全体的な性能を向上させる。投票、平均化、またはスタッキング方法で分散とバイアスを減少させる。",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "lang": "ja",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T16:02:30.226695+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "d7531de12aa39c1c211e36eef96fb2c8"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "Ensemble learning: Combine multiple model predictions to improve overall performance. Reduce variance and bias via voting, averaging, or stacking methods.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "lang": "vi",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T16:02:30.226695+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "0beaad21ea809772825a172a12de43e4"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI自我学习",
      "content": "对抗训练：通过生成对抗样本，提高模型鲁棒性。学会识别并抵抗恶意攻击，提高安全性。",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
