    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "Adversarial training: Through generating adversarial examples, improve model robustness. Learn to recognize and resist malicious attacks, improving security.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "lang": "vi",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T16:02:30.226695+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "4b6571475590c74ce6a61bf5e08c68de"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI自我学习",
      "content": "终身学习：模型在多个任务上持续学习，避免遗忘旧知识。记忆管理+知识迁移是关键。这是一个长期研究目标。",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "lang": "zh",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T16:02:30.226695+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "2f0c92f56bb95123961b498468f97830"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI自己学習",
      "content": "生涯学習：モデルが複数のタスクにまたがって継続的に学習し、古い知識を忘れないようにする。メモリ管理＋知識移転が鍵。これは長期的な研究目標である。",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "lang": "ja",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T16:02:30.225694+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "93be486739ca075fe39c737990b67386"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "Lifelong learning: Model learns continuously across multiple tasks, avoiding forgetting old knowledge. Memory management + knowledge transfer are key. This is a long-term research goal.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "lang": "en",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T16:02:30.225694+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "4a5cd20726a1ac5b7d1ff00c29cd8fcd"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "Lifelong learning: Model học liên tục multiple tasks, tránh quên kiến thức cũ. Memory management + knowledge transfer là key. Đây là long-term research goal.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "lang": "vi",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T16:02:30.225694+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "249ad36e0eeb53d548eeac4810a52d78"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "集成学习 (Ensemble Learning): 结合多个模型的预测来提高整体性能. 通过投票、平均或堆叠等方法，可以减少方差和偏差，提高泛化能力.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "7c7f299658233b4f4468e3471bca0464"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "对抗训练 (Adversarial Training): 通过生成对抗样本来提高模型的鲁棒性. 让模型学会识别和抵抗恶意攻击，提高安全性.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "0f0a9dd39a507b6e8c4a2dfbd98d924f"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "终身学习 (Lifelong Learning): 模型在多个任务上持续学习，同时避免遗忘旧知识. 这是一个长期的研究目标，涉及记忆管理和知识迁移等多个方面.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "079d2e1184fd456fbab52ae2b49faa6d"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "Few-shot Learning: 模型在只有少量标注样本的情况下进行学习. 通过利用先验知识或元学习，可以在新任务上取得良好的性能. 在医疗和罕见事件检测中很有用.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "bc9528a33cb4a263ae6e2071a9f25781"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "课程学习 (Curriculum Learning): 让模型按照从简单到困难的顺序学习数据. 这种方法可以加速收敛并提高最终性能. 类似于人类的学习过程.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "b59807544655ef815da8c32945401165"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "教师-学生模型 (Teacher-Student): 使用一个大型的教师模型来指导小型的学生模型的学习. 通过知识蒸馏，可以让学生模型逼近教师模型的性能.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "67d735e10f55ac359dedcfe1bef09eeb"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "在线学习 (Online Learning): 模型在数据流中实时更新参数. 适用于数据动态变化的场景，如推荐系统和欺诈检测. 需要处理概念漂移的问题.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "6a69b4f1e8c12bee8fc3c5cdb25c8c30"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "迁移学习 (Transfer Learning): 将从一个任务中学到的知识应用到另一个相关任务上. 预训练模型通常在大规模数据集上训练，然后在特定任务上进行微调.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "9c544623ce34d9fbbd1a29e767a1f93f"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "强化学习 (Reinforcement Learning): 智能体通过与环境交互来学习策略. 奖励信号指导智能体的行为. 在游戏 AI 和机器人控制中应用广泛.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "3e871b6f034dbc5bcb16cc4bb04b53ff"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "自监督学习 (Self-Supervised Learning): 利用数据本身的结构来生成标签，不需要人工标注. 例如，在自然语言处理中，可以通过预测缺失的单词来学习.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "87216e4e66b693e297b587a3d6f2378b"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "元学习 (Meta-Learning): 让模型学会如何学习. 通过在多个相关任务上训练，模型可以快速适应新的任务. 常见的方法有 MAML 和 Reptile.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "d1acafde9e06fd378866dd61b294bfef"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "主动学习 (Active Learning): 模型可以主动选择最有价值的样本进行学习，从而减少标注成本. 通常通过不确定性采样或多样性采样来选择样本.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "6fded5edf8fc63b4d6428c52d32d7f9f"
    },
    {
      "type": "update",
      "topic": "AI Self-Learning",
      "content": "增量学习 (Incremental Learning): 模型在不忘记旧知识的前提下，逐步学习新知识. 通过使用正则化或记忆重放等技术，可以减少灾难性遗忘的问题.",
      "source": "ai_selflearning_protocol",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-10T15:37:30.731105+00:00",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "content_hash": "3adb6dc53e938ff7b76f50e83ccb620d"
    }
  ]
}